propertiesMeta.description:
Defines the direction the grid’s auto-placement algorithm uses when placing items that don’t have an explicit position. 
With row, items are filled left-to-right across each row before continuing on the next row; 
with column, items are filled top-to-bottom down each column before continuing in the next column.

Defines the direction the flex container uses when placing items. 
With Row, items are placed left-to-right; 
with Column, items are placed top-to-bottom down.
